{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "740b465c8bd0f3d546659c4de29006b8947f2633f3621e95d58ceac5d5712ba8", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\n伊織は『ドラゴン』の衣装で撮ることになった）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "f58a929ac2f17a3a89a2e459dc4d78a6e69fee86733716d7d2e90e1799923d6b", "ja": "あ！　ちょっと風の噂で聞いたんだけど、私が「怒ると\n恐いから」ドラゴンの衣装を選んだんですって？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1002_p", "source_sha256": "10e3915c1066af06aa8112910dfcc338f2bdeb27a96d6ed5a6f168b583d5f9fc", "ja": "え！？　いやいやそれは誤解してるぞ！　まず第一に\nデザインが似合うと思ったのが大きくて……。伊織？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4a6726465eb216afd91065cd5bfcd7fdf5d0a504b57634f0e9322c5676ad99ab", "ja": "ど、どうした？\nもしかして不服なのか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "d05ea6c28502625473a8f82e396defb03a3b206edbe3f694b80ebd838d3fe8ee", "ja": "いいえ。デザインは素敵よ。でもそれなら、どうして\n「怒ると恐い」なんて噂が回ってきたのかしら……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e5ee15aaeab4737da80ca60191304224430034cf7b6d8482ebfec8286ff42810", "ja": "俺は、正しく怒れるのは伊織のいいところだと思うし、\nその凛とした佇まいも、威厳があるっていうか……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ae76fe9a7ffcdf2c942354acbc2e9ead1cb28283cce67a58ece3dea6b2945010", "ja": "それでドラゴンが似合うと思ったんだけど、変なふうに\n尾ひれがついて、伝わっちゃったのかもしれないな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "1a3bc833241835a8398389053c0fd414a9e199efca53580298e6a446d6d9b73d", "ja": "「正しく怒れる」？　怒るのなんて、そんなに良いこと\nじゃないでしょ？　……ちょっと気にしてるんだから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ec9e43186f9f5fdbd2f9cedb12276a13766a07df9307c5f429c582e70f3a538e", "ja": "……なあ、ドラゴンはなぜ恐いと思う？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "33a6962bc9882367d9166db963055f0fbd6ed4d1874660bc4e5d250de3f5d564", "ja": "なによ急に。……そうね、とても強くて、\nみんな勝てないって思っちゃうからじゃない？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1011_p", "source_sha256": "944b1a72ee9e81bea56d7b0ed66a53e7c2cf94581b9a984f43dbd0d55c567bef", "ja": "なるほど、それも一理あるが……\nそれだけじゃないと思ってるんだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c426ffad2451d726f938b90a39878866ba40a9f54c574730d34a49c8c042fe67", "ja": "それは……守るものがあるから。そして守るものの\nために、誇りをもって大きな力を行使するからだ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "ab66d746db5a5602404aefee088d38fa2e98cd07d83551c855a283b3f689ab3b", "ja": "それが……ドラゴンが恐いと思われる理由なの？\n何が言いたいの、{$P$}？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1014_p", "source_sha256": "25622eab7e70c1faaba299ba307d6c8dc99ff00ef78c8a6e1e5d87552a173d14", "ja": "うん、伊織も同じだと思うんだ。たしかに伊織は\n怒ることがあるかもしれない。でも、それはなんでだ？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "be92576b37a16e1c1b25f4b7c87ae77f3e0cbd0ca85a0c2d657cb0654b22148d", "ja": "……理不尽に屈したくないから、かしら。そうじゃ\nないと、自分の大切にしてるものが、壊れちゃうから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c7acee71db187e2666cc0d324271d95a21ea1a9ac8f77f374a99e837c6015a50", "ja": "そうだ。それを俺は立派だと思う。大抵の人は、誇り\nのために怒るより、なあなあでやり過ごすことを選ぶ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2add38d98473bd6b23f5536561e30d4a804d65258ad98886867a79eb238e188d", "ja": "怒るって、なかなかできることじゃないんだ。\nそれは、誇り高さの証だ。俺はそれを尊敬してる。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "8bbc70252bedaa77d7eb6312e3e6b84bc1fc846cf13d50446146cb8fa75b3e1f", "ja": "……フン。いいわ。いつもの口から出まかせで\nしょうけど、一定の理はあったかもね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1019_p", "source_sha256": "db553d893c6796d4c65790dcce33811c6ab4671f3354518ea553b33ed7b078aa", "ja": "怒ってる姿も御愛嬌さ。何よりも伊織が真剣に\nアイドルに取り組んでることを、俺は知ってるからな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "9df85871c3035c953561e8be97974e4345acc638ed8d3afa17160b61e9db9192", "ja": "はぁ？　何よそれ、褒めてるの？\nまったく、要領がいいんだから……仕方ないわね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "61cf035e6ff5588fa6eec853187f116e81b31a0b9bc0ba583509b3f60dda2edd", "ja": "この伊織ちゃんがどれだけ偉大か、その目に\n刻みなさい！　グラビア撮影、気合入れていくわよっ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1022_p", "source_sha256": "1a264dee2b113fbca72ea94e74d7fb86c2639c40a5d17edf86768e4ca0ee5179", "ja": "よし、その意気だ！　ありがとう、\nきっといい画が撮れるな！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0633_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "70599c91deca19697fd7b9cf5a766a92ae24d184837f8a047fab74313887c9e4", "ja": "そうよ。この強くて気高い伊織ちゃんに、\nまかせなさい！　がお～！　ってね♪　にひひっ！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
